omx-clap-host (0.20.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * 0.20.1: the fuzz harnesses read their inputs themselves, every check
    records its bug (#345)
  * fuzz: README and BUILDING.md name as_written, the records and
    fuzz/sabotage/ (#345)
  * fuzz: make fuzz-records, every check's record met alone, and the ratchet
    (#345)
  * fuzz: the mutants are fuzz/sabotage/, each naming its check and seed
    (#345)
  * fuzz_manifest: the harness reads the naming rule itself, for every URI
    (#345)
  * fuzz_preset: the harness reads the JSON and renders the writer's format
    itself (#345)
  * fuzz_state: the harness reads the base64 itself (#345)

